trust-heading = How much should I do on my own?
trust-lead = Pick one for now. You can adjust it per task or plan later.
trust-cautious-name = Cautious
trust-cautious-desc = Ask before doing anything.
trust-cautious-example = Even reminders get a quick check first.
trust-balanced-name = Balanced (recommended)
trust-balanced-desc = Look things up, set reminders and log expenses on my own; ask before spending or speaking for you.
trust-balanced-example = Reminders are set directly; food orders show a confirmation.
trust-hands-off-name = Hands-off
trust-hands-off-desc = Handle small recurring payments too and tell you afterwards. Everything can be undone.
trust-hands-off-example = Pay the electricity bill when due and log it in Daily.
trust-red-lines = Paying, signing contracts and contacting new people always pause for your approval, whatever you pick.
phone-heading = Connect your phone too
phone-lead = With your phone connected you can check reminders and approve things on the go. Everything syncs over your local network, never through a server.
